    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699530/extras/0ccf81ba4b1e380cae9d39b89b7adf62.avif?t=1710730957\" width=600 height=250 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699530/extras/db6eb7957aaaae90096d590707468577.poster.avif?t=1710730957\" width=598 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699530/extras/db6eb7957aaaae90096d590707468577.webm?t=1710730957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699530/extras/db6eb7957aaaae90096d590707468577.mp4?t=1710730957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Granny has disappeared and there are cats causing mayhem all over the world! Use your gadgets and abilities to put a stop to the kitty-chaos, and figure out what happened to Granny.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699530/extras/6a48e4f2c39a7b2868e8bb0a550da1f2.webp?t=1710730957\" width=32 height=32 /></span>Use your gadgets and abilities to capture the cats that are scattered about the game's levels. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699530/extras/6a48e4f2c39a7b2868e8bb0a550da1f2.webp?t=1710730957\" width=32 height=32 /></span>Each cat has unique stats and abilities, learn what tools and requirements each cat needs to be captured. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699530/extras/6a48e4f2c39a7b2868e8bb0a550da1f2.webp?t=1710730957\" width=32 height=32 /></span>After capturing a cat, they will get added to the cat caf\u00e9 where they can be safely looked after until Granny is found. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699530/extras/6a48e4f2c39a7b2868e8bb0a550da1f2.webp?t=1710730957\" width=32 height=32 /></span>Collect coins and unlock cosmetics for the cat caf\u00e9, watch it develop from an empty building to a bustling cat paradise. <br><br><br><br>Team up with quirky allies and explore the world of Snyatcher to unravel the mystery of Granny's disappearance!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699530/extras/0ccf81ba4b1e380cae9d39b89b7adf62.avif?t=1710730957\" width=600 height=250 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699530/extras/db6eb7957aaaae90096d590707468577.poster.avif?t=1710730957\" width=598 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699530/extras/db6eb7957aaaae90096d590707468577.webm?t=1710730957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699530/extras/db6eb7957aaaae90096d590707468577.mp4?t=1710730957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Granny has disappeared and there are cats causing mayhem all over the world! Use your gadgets and abilities to put a stop to the kitty-chaos, and figure out what happened to Granny.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699530/extras/6a48e4f2c39a7b2868e8bb0a550da1f2.webp?t=1710730957\" width=32 height=32 /></span>Use your gadgets and abilities to capture the cats that are scattered about the game's levels. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699530/extras/6a48e4f2c39a7b2868e8bb0a550da1f2.webp?t=1710730957\" width=32 height=32 /></span>Each cat has unique stats and abilities, learn what tools and requirements each cat needs to be captured. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699530/extras/6a48e4f2c39a7b2868e8bb0a550da1f2.webp?t=1710730957\" width=32 height=32 /></span>After capturing a cat, they will get added to the cat caf\u00e9 where they can be safely looked after until Granny is found. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2699530/extras/6a48e4f2c39a7b2868e8bb0a550da1f2.webp?t=1710730957\" width=32 height=32 /></span>Collect coins and unlock cosmetics for the cat caf\u00e9, watch it develop from an empty building to a bustling cat paradise. <br><br><br><br>Team up with quirky allies and explore the world of Snyatcher to unravel the mystery of Granny's disappearance!",
